at cheered markets. \par \par \uc2  ** Spot coverage of possible developments and wrapups \par \par \uc2  ** Analysis of what a possible merger would mean for confidence in Japanese banking system \par \par \uc2  - - - - \par \par \uc2  FINANCIAL MARKETS \par \par \uc2  TOKYO/LONDON - Dollar erases its gains against the yen in late Asian trade as the yen is buoyed by news that Japan's Sumitomo Trust & Banking Co Ltd is considering a merger with the Long-Term Credit Bank of Japan (LTCB). In Europe, stock markets are expected to open weak as the Dow's rally appears to fade with a lacklustre finish on Wall Stre ** Four separate surveys will be wrapped together into a focus wrap (afternoon) \par \par \uc2  - - - - \par \par \uc2  AUSTRALIA'S BHP HIT BY LOSSES \par \par \uc2  MELBOURNE - Australia's corporate flagship, the Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd (BHP), announces only second loss this century after writedowns of more than $1.8 billion. \par \par \uc2  ** Full wrap with more details, reaction \par \par \uc2  - - - - \par \par \uc2  INDONESIA \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA - Indonesia's beleaguered financial markets ignore a fresh deal with International Monetary Fund, with the rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sinking below 15,000 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  ** Regular market reports \par \par \uc2  ** Wrap of overall developments \par \par \uc2  - - - - \par \par \uc2  STRIKING PAL PILOTS END STRIKE \par \par \uc2  MANILA - Philippine Airlines pilots call off three-week strike after finally heeding a government order to return to work, but it may be too late. \par \par \uc2  ** Story on decision and including look at very different airline that is getting rid of most of its fleet and has sacked more than a third of its workforce \par \par \uc2  - - - - \par \par \uc2  VIETNAM TRADE \par \par \uc2  HANOI - A senior U.S. official says protracted negotiations to seal a Vietnam-United States trade pact are inching forward but it could be years before any agreement comes into force. \par \par \uc2  ** Story updating status of Vietnam-United States trade talks \par \par \uc2  - - - - \par \par \uc2  If queries please call \par \par \uc2  Singapore (65) 870-3815 \par \par \uc2  Comments to: asia.newseds@reuters.com. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6q020jl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
