\par\par \b \uc2  Japan Money Rates Inch Down On BOJ's Generous Stance \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 1998\par 04:21\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    TOKYO (Nikkei/Dow Jones)--Japan's unsecured overnight\par call rates edged lower Thursday morning as the Bank of Japan\par maintained its generous stance.\par    Just after the BOJ's action, the unsecured overnight call\par money traded at 0.43%, down 0.02 point from Wednesday.\par    The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  drained Y400 billion from the money\par market at 0020 GMT (8:20 p.m. EDT Wednesday), but the action\par is widely viewed as generous, since banks' reserve surplus\par stayed unchanged at Y800 billion from Wednesday after the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operation\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par    The fall was modest since demand for call loans was\par strong on persisting concerns over Japan's financial system,\par traders said.\par    Prices of Euroyen interest rate futures were higher, led\par by the September futures contract, as traders covered short\par positions that they built up Wednesday.\par    Around 0152 GMT (9:52 p.m. EDT), the lead December\par futures contract yielded 0.73%, down 0.01 point from\par Wednesday.\par    The September contract yielded 0.71%, down 0.02 point.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    The yen's rapid appreciation against the dollar after a\par joint dollar-selling \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the U.S. and\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , increased the possibility of further credit easing, a\par trader at Societe Generale Securities said.\par    Yen/yen swap rates in mid- and long-term deals were\par higher. The seven-year swap rates were quoted at 1.56%-1.60%,\par up 0.03 point from Wednesday.\par    Certificates of deposit have yet to change hands.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  06-17-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2221EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4154 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du6i01jty\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
