\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-EU's Brittan presses Japan to reform. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Adrian Croft \par \uc2 497 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 1998\par 18:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRUSSELS, June 18 (Reuters) - European Trade Commissioner Sir Leon Brittan on Thursday welcomed U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the Japanese yen and urged \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to carry out urgent structural reforms to lift its recession-hit economy. \par \par \uc2  Brittan also raised the question of whether or how the powerful new European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would use its muscle to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in a similar situation in future. \par \par \uc2  In a speech to an Australian business group in Brussels, Brittan said a recovery of the Japanese economy and a stronger yen would play a crucial part in spurring a resumption of growth in Asia and in easing pressure on other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , especially the Chinese yuan. \par \par \uc2  "For this to happen, the Japanese authorities now need to embark upon a far-reaching, urgent programme of structural reform, coupled perhaps with a further fiscal boost to stimulate domestic demand," Brittan, the European Union's top trade official, said. \par \par \uc2  He said a "downward spiral" of the Japanese economy would pose "grave risks for the region as a whole and the world economy". \par \par \uc2  "We have to do everything we can to persuade the Japanese government to take the right measures at the right time (and to) tackle the overhang of non-performing assets ...," he said. \par \par \uc2  Brittan welcomed Japanese Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto's announcement on Wednesday that Japan would speed up its fiscal stimulus package and reform corporate and personal taxation. \par \par \uc2  He also welcomed Wednesday's U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in support of the yen. \par \par \uc2  "Individual European countries will no doubt be deciding whether to lend their support," Brittan said. \par \par \uc2  The yen's sharp fall in recent weeks had fuelled concerns that China might be forced to devalue its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , possibly unleashing a devastating new round of devaluations in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the U.S. and Japanese authorities in New York trading on Wednesday saw the yen rally over five yen against the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  Brittan noted that from next January the EU would have a new \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the euro, with a single \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and would therefore have a much greater role to play in the international monetary system. Eleven EU nations are set to launch the euro. \par \par \uc2  In future, Brittan said, Europe would be able to take a collective decision to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the markets as the United States had just been doing. \par \par \uc2  "If on any occasion Europe decides to do so, that will be a decision of global importance, which could have a major impact on the world economy," he said. \par \par \uc2  "So it is essential that the EU should quickly set up the necessary mechanisms to allow rapid decisions to be taken on whether, when, and to what extent the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in situations such as this," he said. ((Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6830, fax +32 2 230 5573, brussels.newsroomreuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6i02oa3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
